    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You use your mechanical strength to restrain and damage enemies.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Claw\" title=\"Claw\">Claw</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hand\" title=\"Hand\">Hand</a> Appendage, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pin\" title=\"Pin\">Pin</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Crush\" title=\"Crush\">Crush</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you successfully <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pin\" title=\"Pin\">Pin</a> an enemy, you can maintain the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pin\" title=\"Pin\">Pin</a> beyond 1 round and can make subsequent <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> checks against the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pinned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pinned\">Pinned</a> enemy as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>. You can apply the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Crush\" title=\"Crush\">Crush</a> Feat whenever your subsequent checks are successful.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> checks are a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pin\" title=\"Pin\">Pin</a> Feat must be rerolled each round as a new <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> check.</p><p><b>Special:</b> You must have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Claw\" title=\"Claw\">Claw</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hand\" title=\"Hand\">Hand</a> Appendage to use this Feat.</p>",
